{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fast Fingers \u2013 Demo Version</strong> \ud83c\udfb6\u2328\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help a child complete their homework and experience the excitement of rhythm-based typing! <strong>Fast Fingers Demo</strong> is designed to let you try out the core mechanics of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca1 <strong>What\u2019s Included in the Demo?</strong><br>\u2705 <strong>First 3 Levels</strong> \u2013 Start the child\u2019s homework adventure.<br>\u2705 <strong>3 Music Genres</strong> \u2013 Test your typing skills with Phonk\u2019s powerful beats, TikTok trend songs, and fast-paced electronic music.<br>\u2705 <strong>Falling Words from the Sky</strong> \u2013 Type the words in the correct order to help the child complete their homework.<br>\u2705 <strong>Increasing Difficulty</strong> \u2013 Words fall faster, rhythms change\u2014stay sharp!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3458130?t=1740236292","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740236292","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458130/72ef0b46aa2f73cf18c8a49eef2535419e66230f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740236292","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458130/72ef0b46aa2f73cf18c8a49eef2535419e66230f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740236292","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fast Fingers \u2013 Demo Version</strong> \ud83c\udfb6\u2328\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help a child complete their homework and experience the excitement of rhythm-based typing! <strong>Fast Fingers Demo</strong> is designed to let you try out the core mechanics of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud8